# gen_fu_l40c_quiesce_exhaustion.log -- landing 40c (TB Infra, 2026-09-04)
#
# WHAT THIS IS. Landing 40's quiesce loop had one hole, CM215-Low-1: on the EXHAUSTION path the assertion read a
# fresh sample after the loop, so a loop that never saw two adjacent equal samples could still be handed one equal
# instant and pass. The break path was sound. This log carries the hole read from the committed file, a
# discriminating red at model level, the simulation proof that the new gate fires, the regression, and the red
# fixture. CM215-Low-4 is in the same touch: the comment pasted in three tests is now one full text and two
# pointers.
# PATHS: $S is this session's scratchpad; the two roots kept from landing 40 are reused, so the change is Python
# only and no rebuild was needed. BUILD IDENTITY below is the local runner's find-digest, never the committer's
# gate digest, and no committed gate identity is claimed for these roots.
#
# ================ THE HOLE, read from the committed file ================
# $ git show 9f47277:dv/auto_dv/gen_tb/gen_tests/gen_ut_lockstep.py | sed -n '50,63p'
#       settled = 0
#       for _ in range(QUIESCE_CYCLES):
#           if int(h.b.evt_retired_count.value) == int(h.b.evt_isa_records.value):
#               settled += 1
#               if settled == 2:
#                   break
#           else:
#               settled = 0
#           await b.wait_cycles_until(int(h.b.cycle_count.value) + 1)
#       retired = int(h.b.evt_retired_count.value)
#       consumed = int(h.b.evt_isa_records.value)
#       mism = int(h.b.evt_isa_mismatch.value)
#       log.info("GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP retired %d consumed %d mismatches %d tohost 0x%08x", retired, consumed, mism,
#                int(h.b.evt_eot_code.value))
# The two reads after the loop are a 21st sample. If samples 1 to 20 never held equal twice in a row and sample 21
# reads equal while a record is in flight, the assertion passes on a single instant, which is the defect landing 40
# was written to remove. The break path never had this problem: it leaves the loop only after two adjacent equal
# samples.
# THE FIX: the loop samples into the variables the assertion uses, nothing is read after the loop, and the
# reporting assertion is gated on settled == 2, so the bound only ever decides how long to wait. The new gate is
# strictly stronger than the old equality assertion, so it REPLACES it rather than standing beside it.
# $ sed -n '47,63p' dv/auto_dv/gen_tb/gen_tests/gen_ut_lockstep.py   [the landed shape]
#       # The pair's two writers, and why one instant is not enough: see gen_ut_intg_store.py.
#       settled = 0
#       for _ in range(QUIESCE_CYCLES):
#           retired = int(h.b.evt_retired_count.value)
#           consumed = int(h.b.evt_isa_records.value)
#           if retired == consumed:
#               settled += 1
#               if settled == 2:
#                   break
#           else:
#               settled = 0
#           await b.wait_cycles_until(int(h.b.cycle_count.value) + 1)
#       mism = int(h.b.evt_isa_mismatch.value)
#       log.info("GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP retired %d consumed %d mismatches %d tohost 0x%08x", retired, consumed, mism,
#                int(h.b.evt_eot_code.value))
#       assert retired > 0, "GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP: nothing retired"
#       assert settled == 2, f"GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP: comparator consumed {consumed} records, {retired} retired (must be equal and hold across a cycle; {QUIESCE_CYCLES} cycles waited)"
#
# ================ THE DISCRIMINATING RED, at model level ================
# The case is not constructible in simulation (see the section below), so the discrimination is shown on the
# predicate itself. The model is committed with the tests it models, as a unit test with a --self-test, so the next
# reader can run it: dv/auto_dv/tb/unit/gen_ut_pair_quiesce_model.py.
# $ python3 dv/auto_dv/tb/unit/gen_ut_pair_quiesce_model.py --self-test ; echo rc=$?
#   in-flight stream: 21 samples, equal at even indices including the one past the bound; adjacent equal pairs inside the bound: 0
#     sampled after the loop   verdict=PASS  retired=31 consumed=31 settled=0
#     sampled in the loop      verdict=FAIL  retired=31 consumed=30 settled=0
#   settled stream: unequal once then equal; sampled in the loop verdict=PASS retired=31 consumed=31 settled=2
#   SELF-TEST PASS
#   rc=0
# ONE STREAM, TWO VERDICTS: the same in-flight sample stream is a PASS when the assertion samples after the loop
# and a FAIL when it samples inside it. A genuinely settled stream still passes, which is the other side of the
# check. The self-test asserts both, and it also reads gen_ut_intg_store.py so that a later change to the test
# makes the model report itself stale rather than quietly modelling nothing.
# POSITIVE CONTROL on the self-test, because a check that cannot fail proves nothing: the same file run against an
# archive of 9f47277, whose tests carry the pre-40c shape.
# $ python3 $S/l33/dig/9f47277/dv/auto_dv/tb/unit/gen_ut_pair_quiesce_model.py --self-test ; echo rc=$?
#   settled stream: unequal once then equal; sampled in the loop verdict=PASS retired=31 consumed=31 settled=2
#   SELF-TEST FAIL: gen_ut_intg_store.py no longer contains 'assert settled == 2': this model may be stale
#   SELF-TEST FAILED
#   rc=1   [the tail above is the last three lines of that one run, not a second run]
#
# ================ THE EXHAUSTION PATH IN SIMULATION ================
# MUT-RETSKEW1, the landing-40 mutation that leaves one retirement the comparator never consumes, drives the loop
# to its bound. Re-run on the 40c tests on the same mutated build:
# $ tail of $S/l33/l40c_runs.log, the cmlkA_ and cmspA_ blocks
#   == 40C EXHAUSTION PROOF: MUT-RETSKEW1 build, the 40c tests, expect FAIL through the settled gate
#   seed 1            verdict=FAIL     GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP retired 176 consumed 175 mismatches 0 tohost 0x00000001 AssertionError: GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP: comparator consumed 175 records, 176 retired (must be equal and hold across a cycle; 20 cycles waited)
#   seed 391581543    verdict=FAIL     GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP retired 177 consumed 176 mismatches 0 tohost 0x00000001 AssertionError: GEN_UT_LOCKSTEP: comparator consumed 176 records, 177 retired (must be equal and hold across a cycle; 20 cycles waited)
#   SWEEP DONE lockstep prefix=cmlkA_ seeds=2 2026-09-04T21:27:56Z
#   seed 3            verdict=FAIL      
#   seed 13           verdict=FAIL      
#   SWEEP DONE intg_span prefix=cmspA_ seeds=2 2026-09-04T21:28:02Z
# $ command grep -h 'sources sha256' $S/l33/l40_mut_root/outC/config_opts.txt
#   sources sha256 (dv/auto_dv env, tb, isa, gen_tb): 7ef155c3ddcab7fd
# The failure now comes THROUGH THE NEW GATE and says so in its message: "must be equal and hold across a cycle;
# 20 cycles waited". Read this for what it is: a positive control that the new assertion's exhaustion path fires,
# NOT a discriminating red between landing 40 and 40c, because the old shape also failed on this mutation (its
# 21st sample was unequal too). The discrimination is the model above. On intg_span the mutation is still caught
# earlier by the export sink, as landing 40 recorded, so those two runs remain no evidence about the loop.
# WHY THE TRANSIENT CASE IS NOT CONSTRUCTIBLE HERE, stated as reasoning and not as a measurement: to reach sample
# 21 the stream must deny two adjacent equal samples for twenty cycles, which needs a record retiring in nearly
# every cycle, and then the 21st sample must fall equal while a record is still in flight, which needs the cadence
# to break exactly there. No knob in this TB drives retirement at that density with that phase, and lengthening
# the run does not change the phase. That is why the predicate is judged on the model instead.
#
